# Ordered XNU patch series for rodin. One patch per line, paths relative to
# this directory; # starts a comment. An empty series is valid.

# The Linux cross toolchain builds plain arm64 (not arm64e) without Rosetta,
# which makes both reserved10 fields in struct pmap active upstream.
0001-pmap-rename-second-reserved10.patch
# The Linux toolchain has no macOS SDK, so CodeSignature/Entitlements.h is
